sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin
    participant CD as Claude Desktop
    participant MCP as mcp-ops (Python)
    participant API as backend-ops (Go)
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant S3 as MinIO

    rect rgb(245,246,250)
    Note over CD,MCP: once, at launch
    CD->>MCP: spawn over stdio, initialize, tools/list
    MCP-->>CD: 5 tools, each with _meta.ui.resourceUri
    end

    Admin->>CD: "pending orders over 50,000 yen from last week"
    CD->>CD: model picks list_orders and fills the arguments
    CD->>MCP: tools/call list_orders

    rect rgb(255,247,240)
    Note over MCP,API: first call only
    MCP->>API: POST /api/v1/login admin@gmail.com
    API-->>MCP: user_id 31, is_admin true
    end

    MCP->>API: GET /admin/orders?status=pending&min_total=50000&days=7<br/>X-Stockroom-User 31
    API->>DB: SELECT is_admin  (requireAdmin, every request)
    API->>DB: filtered query, one round trip
    DB-->>API: rows
    API-->>MCP: orders + applied (the filter as understood)
    MCP-->>CD: structuredContent

    CD->>MCP: resources/read ui://stockroom/orders
    MCP-->>CD: one self-contained HTML, MIME text/html profile=mcp-app
    CD->>CD: render in a sandboxed iframe, push the result in
    CD-->>Admin: panel, pre-filled from the prompt, plus the written answer

    rect rgb(240,250,244)
    Note over Admin,DB: refining inside the panel skips the model entirely
    Admin->>CD: types a customer name in the panel
    CD->>MCP: tools/call list_orders (from the iframe)
    MCP->>API: GET /admin/orders?q=carol&status=pending&...
    API->>DB: filtered query
    MCP-->>CD: structuredContent
    CD-->>Admin: panel re-renders, no tokens spent
    end

    rect rgb(250,245,250)
    Note over Admin,S3: product photos load straight from the API
    Admin->>API: GET /media/{key}  (browser, CSP-allowed origin)
    API->>S3: object read
    S3-->>API: bytes
    API-->>Admin: image
    end
